commit fe8fd1622c9763bc658e29bb46c9cd9f1fbf3a91
Author: xjdaniel <xjdaniel@aliyun.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 4 00:06:34 2026 +0800

    feat: release v1.0.0-rc-wy02.22 with multi-model and stability improvements
    
    This release includes:
    - Added context overflow auto recovery feature
    - Expanded supported model lists for Codex and Zhipu
    - Fixed SSE stream write concurrency issues
    - Improved error handling for upstream non-JSON responses
    - Updated frontend UI styling and i18n translations
    - Added one-click deployment docker-compose config
    - Added ICRA/MPS public security and ICP filing info
    - Optimized Claude channel for text file and image handling

